{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o093a","title":"曹操破尹楷沮鹄并受二县降","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o093a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹洪留攻邺，曹操出击尹楷、沮鹄获胜，韩范、梁岐举县投降受封。","evidence":["wudi-e-o093a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0075","role":"留攻","evidence":["wudi-e-o093a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"出击受降","evidence":["wudi-e-o093a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0209","role":"被击败","evidence":["wudi-e-o093a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0210","role":"被击败","evidence":["wudi-e-o093a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0211","role":"投降","evidence":["wudi-e-o093a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0212","role":"投降","evidence":["wudi-e-o093a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"毛城、邯郸、易阳、涉","evidence":["wudi-e-o093a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安九年夏四月","year":204,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o093a-q","wudi-q-o092","wudi-q-b-6787e3ddd3e334b677d4"],"chronology":"wudi-y204","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o092","basis":"建安九年夏四月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,508,"O093a"],"order":219},{"id":"zhangle-e-o040g","title":"徐晃破邯郸劝降韩范请曹操保全易阳","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o040g-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"徐晃破邯郸劝降韩范请曹操保全易阳","evidence":["zhangle-e-o040g-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0180","role":"征讨劝降","evidence":["zhangle-e-o040g-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0211","role":"降","evidence":["zhangle-e-o040g-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"准降","evidence":["zhangle-e-o040g-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"徐晃从曹操后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o040g-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o040g-q","source_order":[17,146,"O040g"],"order":3578}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0211","name":"韩范","evidence":["wudi-q-o093","zhangle-q-o040"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o093-wudi-p0211","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o093"]},{"id":"zhangle-m-o040-wudi-p0211","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o040"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o093a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b849d99c230efe708c30","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，留曹洪攻邺；公自将击楷，破之而还。尚将沮鹄守邯郸〖7〗；﹝一﹞又击，拔之。易阳令韩范、涉长梁岐举县降，赐爵关内侯〖8〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":507,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-6787e3ddd3e334b677d4","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-6787e3ddd3e334b677d4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗九年：建安九年（公元 204）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":510,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c8fff97bafc82c655f3f","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o092","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3e549c423b15df48398a","layer":"original","quote":"九年春正月〖1〗，济河，遏淇水入白沟以通粮道〖2〗。二月，尚复攻谭，留苏由、审配守邺〖3〗。公进军到洹水〖4〗，由降；既至，攻邺，为土山、地道。武安长尹楷屯毛城〖5〗，通上党粮道〖6〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":506,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o093","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b849d99c230efe708c30","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，留曹洪攻邺；公自将击楷，破之而还。尚将沮鹄守邯郸〖7〗；﹝一﹞又击，拔之。易阳令韩范、涉长梁岐举县降，赐爵关内侯〖8〗。五月，毁土山、地道；作围堑，决漳水灌城〖9〗。城中饿死者过半。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":507,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o040g-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-e7ed3fa863e93b8dd8f5","layer":"original","quote":"太祖既围邺，破邯郸。易阳令韩范，伪以城降而拒守，太祖遣晃攻之。晃至，飞矢城中，为陈成败；范悔，晃辄降之〖4〗。既而言于太祖曰：“二袁未破，诸城未下者倾耳而听；今日灭易阳〖5〗，明日皆以死守：恐河北无定时也。愿公降易阳以示诸诚，则莫不望风。”太祖善之。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":145,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":124,"end":249,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o040","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-e7ed3fa863e93b8dd8f5","layer":"original","quote":"太祖授晃兵，使击卷、﹝一﹞原武贼〖1〗；破之，拜裨将军。从征吕布，别降布将赵庶、李邹等。与史涣斩眭固于河内。从破刘备。又从破颜良，拔白马；进至延津，破文丑，拜偏将军。与曹洪击！强贼祝臂，破之。又与史涣击袁绍运车于故市〖2〗，功最多，封都亭侯〖3〗。太祖既围邺，破邯郸。易阳令韩范，伪以城降而拒守，太祖遣晃攻之。晃至，飞矢城中，为陈成败；范悔，晃辄降之〖4〗。既而言于太祖曰：“二袁未破，诸城未下者倾耳而听；今日灭易阳〖5〗，明日皆以死守：恐河北无定时也。愿公降易阳以示诸诚，则莫不望风。”太祖善之。别讨毛城，设伏兵掩击，破三屯。从破袁谭于南皮，讨平原叛贼，克之。从征蹋顿，拜横野将军〖6〗。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":145,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":295,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
